      "created_at": "2015-01-01T22:41:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm pretty sure how this works, but a couple of sentences in the FAQ made me wonder... &nbsp;is a \"hazard space\" a hex in a hazard source's area, or is it the set of hexes that make up the area? &nbsp;basically if I start my turn adjacent to blazing tornado, then move to one hex to another hex in the tornado's area, then end my turn, will the tornado trigger twice?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:09.579Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 13,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 65.0,
