      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I&#39;m pretty sure how this works, but a couple of sentences in the FAQ made me wonder... &nbsp;is a &quot;hazard space&quot; a hex in a hazard source&#39;s area, or is it the set of hexes that make up the area? &nbsp;basically if I start my turn adjacent to blazing tornado, then move to one hex to another hex in the tornado&#39;s area, then end my turn, will the tornado trigger twice?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "actions_summary": [],
      "moderator": false,
      "admin": false,
      "staff": false,
      "user_id": 11144,
      "hidden": false,
      "trust_level": 1,
