      "created_at": "2015-01-01T22:48:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Each Hex is a seperate hazard space, so be careful.</p><p>In your example it would trigger twice.</p><p>Edit: the below post is right, an Impulsion turret will only trigger once per turn for any reason, because anything else breaks the game.</p>",
