      "created_at": "2015-02-04T03:50:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So in the 2nd Scenario of the Baron Blade campaign, when blade is setting up turrets. If I placed a turret that has a Hazard radius of 2, if tachyon wants to melee attack it, would she take the hit for moving in to range 2, then take another hit when she moves adjacent to it. I am asuming it also stacks so if there was a hex where a hero was 2 hexes away from multiple turrets, they both would fire.</p>",
