    {
      "id": 124963,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-06T15:33:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes to both, Impulsion turrets are once per turn, and all hazard attacks require line of sight.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The only attacks that don't require line of sight say they don't.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is important to note that Hazard Attacks made from non-target tokens (like Impaling Structure and Ra's Fire Tornado) are made by the character, but the origin of the attack is the marker, so Ra can attack someone he can't see with his tornado, because the tornado can see them.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:59:05.294Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 11778,
      "topic_slug": "hazard-spaces",
      "display_username": "phantaskippy",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Yes to both, Impulsion turrets are once per turn, and all hazard attacks require line of sight.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The only attacks that don&#39;t require line of sight say they don&#39;t.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is important to note that Hazard Attacks made from non-target tokens (like Impaling Structure and Ra&#39;s Fire Tornado) are made by the character, but the origin of the attack is the marker, so Ra can attack someone he can&#39;t see with his tornado, because the tornado can see them.</p>",
