      "created_at": "2015-02-20T18:19:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I thought of an awesome/wierd strategy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know that if you are pushed into a hazard space the hazard attack activates.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If the Operative uses Kusarigama to pull someone, and they are pulled through multiple hazard spaces, would they be attacked multiple times? Also if she has Hidden Blade Strike she'd attack them for entering her hazard space as well. I'm specifically thinking of a Blazing Tornadoe in between Operative and her target.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:59:05.488Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
