      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-23T15:40:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Luther is correct! (as one might expect :) ) Kusarigama effectively \"teleports\" the target that it moves. She is still crazy-strong in any environment with Hazard Spaces, and I am surprised that we have not seen more Operative in tournament play - she absolutely ruins several strategies that have historically done pretty well.</p>",
